# The scenario editor's dialogs that erase a line of text before printing it
# again: the map size dialog, whose box is dragged so that its coordinates
# change, and the team members dialog, which names the picture under the
# pointer.
# args: -EDITOR
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 259 key RETURN
at 300 shot size_map
at 301 press 110 88
at 310 move 90 70
at 320 move 70 50
at 330 shot size_map_dragging
at 331 release 70 50
at 360 shot size_map_moved
# Cancel goes back to the menu, with Size Map still chosen.
at 361 key ESC
at 401 key DOWN
at 405 key DOWN
at 409 key DOWN
at 419 key RETURN
at 460 shot ai_menu
at 461 key DOWN
at 465 key DOWN
at 470 key RETURN
at 510 shot team_list
at 511 click 160 225
at 551 click 57 43
at 590 shot member_rifle_infantry
at 591 move 320 240
at 630 shot member_ore_truck
at 631 move 580 345
at 670 shot member_none
at 671 quit
